## lsd

`crates/cash-builtins/src/ls_icon_table.rs`, the Nerd Font icons `ls --icons` shows by
file name and extension, is generated from the default icon theme of
[lsd](https://github.com/lsd-rs/lsd) 1.2.0 (`src/theme/icon.rs`), © the lsd
contributors, used under the Apache License 2.0, whose text is in
[licenses/lsd-Apache-2.0.txt](licenses/lsd-Apache-2.0.txt).

Changes: the two tables were lower-cased, de-duplicated and sorted into Rust constant
arrays for a binary search; lsd's theme files, its configuration and the rest of its
code are not used.
